"""Base parent planner for installing_a_modem (task 77), modem_v11: the b1k_rl_guys modem_v10 InstallationPolicy (native 8/10) in one gate-clean file.

Pipeline: search (spin, modem template fit on the head camera) -> navigate (A* on a depth occupancy map) -> raise_hand -> settle_view (fresh fit)
-> pregrasp -> descend -> close -> lift (confirmed by finger width or by the fit) -> carry -> inspect_marker (red power marker resolves the 180 deg
symmetry) -> find_tv (bright screen with a vertical plane, free support beside it) -> place_navigate -> place (lower onto the support) -> release
-> retract -> press_power (fingertip on the red button, grid dither) -> verify_power (green indicator).
Every phase moves on only from what it observes; a stalled servo phase retries or backs off (reopen after a failed pickup, search after a drop),
never by a timeout. log() gives phase, stage, reason and counters. Tunable values are the constants below the template block.
Input: the eight keys of OBS_CONTRACT.md. Output: float32 (23,). Odometry is the proprio base velocity only (native ORB VO not ported); the TV quad
finder is a Sobel region finder. Priors: TEMPLATE_MODEM_* (modem_model.npz sha256 7acfa0aebc38, every 3rd point, rgb 3 bit), JOINTS/LIMITS from
r1pro.urdf and robot_model.json; regenerate with modem_v0/evolve/build_priors.py.
"""
